  "vibe": "Club-night model railway: baize green (#31402e), maroon livery (#7a2e35), signal red (#c23b2e) and cream (#f0e9da). Staatliches sets condensed poster caps; Onest runs the timetable. The world is a working HO layout — a stadium-shaped loop drawn as a 22px slate rail bed with a dashed cream centre line, and three cars actually circulating it on a real parametric path, the signal-red loco leading two maroon coaches and rotating correctly through the 200-radius curves at 0.14 laps a second. A slate station with an arched roof sits top-right, conifers stand at two heights, and a semaphore signal snaps its red arm between clear and danger while its lamp flips green to red. Zero-tilt montage tiles, ruled stats. It owns a DCC throttle slider, signal-box switches, a scrolling timetable and a rolling destination morph.",
